## Experiments

- Each experiment is a lightweight class in `experiments/`
- `__init__` receives instrument objects and experiment parameters; stores them as attributes
- The main logic lives in `run(self) -> xr.Dataset or np.ndarray`
- No hardware setup or teardown inside the experiment class — that happens in the calling script
- Prefer keyword arguments at call site for clarity: `RabiSweep(fgen=fgen, dac=dac, voltages=v_array)`

